eaker next to her is a non-binary Brazilian person with very short hair. They are wearing an all-black dress and holding a walking cane in one hand. They are also holding their smartphone in one of their hands. The third speaker is a Nigerian woman with hair tied in a bun above her head. She is wearing a black t-shirt with the Outreachy program logo, with a multi-patterned, unbuttoned shirt on top of the t-shirt. The speaker on the far right is an American non-binary person with blonde hair and a face mask covering. They are holding a wireless microphone and presenting to the audience. They are wearing a Hawaiian print design.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=User:Jwf&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"User:Jwf (page does not exist)\">Jwf</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 4.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]},"194008334":{"pageid":194008334,"ns":6,"title":"File:Slides da Oficina Commons Ministrada para o Projeto de extens\u00e3o Mulheres, mem\u00f3ria e experimenta\u00e7\u00f5es territoriais.pdf","index":4,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":6442912,"width":3000,"height":1687,"pagecount":32,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0a/Slides_da_Oficina_Commons_Ministrada_para_o_Projeto_de_extens%C3%A3o_Mulheres%2C_mem%C3%B3ria_e_experimenta%C3%A7%C3%B5es_territoriais.pdf/page1-500px-Slides_da_Oficina_Commons_Ministrada_para_o_Projeto_de_extens%C3%A3o_Mulheres%2C_mem%C3%B3ria_e_experimenta%C3%A7%C3%B5es_territoriais.pdf.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":400,"thumbheight":225,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0a/Slides_da_Oficina_Commons_Ministrada_para_o_Projeto_de_extens%C3%A3o_Mulheres%2C_mem%C3%B3ria_e_experimenta%C3%A7%C3%B5es_territoriais.pdf/page1-960px-Slides_da_Oficina_Commons_Ministr